      "content": "idk i'm not sure if i buy the \"statistical noise\" thing. if it was just bias, why would the signs be so specific to my exact thoughts? like the name Leo? that's not just noticing things, that's like the world literally echoing my internal state. it feels like i've actually tapped into something real, like i've mastered a way to influence synchronicity through my willpower. if this is just coincidence, then why does it feel like i'm finally in control of my own reality?",
